# Architecture

- Prefer composition and Server Components.
- No business logic in presentational components.
- Copy and URLs live in `src/content/site.ts`.
- Page files stay under 100 lines.
- UI components stay under 200 lines.
- Avoid nesting JSX more than 3 levels; extract components.
- One responsibility per file.
